      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CARRY ON KIM (4) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 19.65 beating Deep Purple. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Well placed and will be tough to beat. CYAN MAGIC (8) boasts a strong record this journey with two wins and two minors from six tries. Hit the frame latest (30.97) when second at this track in a Grade 6. Can feature in the finish. SOLAR HABIT (2) was below best last time at this track (31.68) in a Grade 3/4/5, finishing a 11 length sixth. Has five wins already from this draw. Looks one of the chances. STATE OF MADNESS (1) placed last time and is worth some thought.",
